OL,5,G0232 Tech Life
OL,6,     FLots of people make a living from
OL,7,     Fsocial media posts. But some have
OL,8,     Fbeen targeted by an international
OL,9,     Fextortion scheme. It involves a
OL,10,     Fflood of false copyright
OL,11,     Finfringement claims.
