OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1944, a weather report
OL,7,     Fpredicted a storm that changed the
OL,8,     Fcourse of WW2 history. The
OL,9,     Fforecast was the first indication
OL,10,     Fof bad weather and led the Allies
OL,11,     Fto delay D-Day.
